OTOGAKURE — RESEARCH PARTICIPATION WAIVER
Issued under the authority of Lord Orochimaru | Form EX-WAIVER

Preamble
Service in the Hidden Sound may include participation in Lord Orochimaru's research. This
waiver formalizes that participation. Signature is a condition of continued service for
any operative selected for a research program.

Terms
1. The undersigned places their body and chakra at the disposal of the Research Division
   for the program(s) to which they are assigned.
2. The undersigned accepts that research procedures — sealing, modification, transplant,
   and others — carry risk of injury, disability, or death.
3. The undersigned accepts that a subject whose body fails is disposed of per compound
   protocol and asks that their remains serve the research.
4. The undersigned releases the Research Division and the village from any claim arising
   from participation. There is no claim to be made; this clause records the understanding.

Standing Clause
In the Sound, the body of every operative is village property from the date of service.
This waiver does not grant a right the operative could otherwise withhold; it records
acknowledgement. Refusal is referred to an officer for review of the operative's standing.

Operative mark: ____________________  Date: ____________
